        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
            CreatorPulse ("the Application") is an Android utility designed to assist YouTube creators with video titles, hooks, retention scripts, thumbnail concepts, and SEO tag strategies.
            We are firmly committed to user privacy and data security. This Privacy Policy details our practices concerning data handling, storage, encryption, and third-party AI services.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Data Collection & Privacy Principles</h2>
        <p>We believe in a <strong>privacy-first, on-device architecture</strong>. Specifically:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>No Account Required:</strong> You do not need to create an account, register, or provide personal credentials (such as your name, email, or YouTube account passwords) to use CreatorPulse.</li>
            <li><strong>No Tracking or Telemetry:</strong> We do not track personal identifiers, device GPS coordinates, contacts, photos, or browsing habits.</li>
            <li><strong>No Sale of Personal Data:</strong> We never sell, rent, or trade any user information.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Local Data Storage & Persistence</h2>
        <p>
            All content created or saved within the app (such as saved video ideas, custom channel benchmarks, favorite titles, script hooks, and tags in the <em>Idea Vault</em>) is stored locally on your device via an encrypted SQLite database using the Android Room persistence library.
        </p>
        <p>
            This data never leaves your device unless you explicitly copy it to your clipboard or send it via your own device's sharing tools. You can permanently erase all saved content at any time via the <strong>Clear All History</strong> button in the Settings tab.
        </p>

        <h2>4. API Keys & Encryption</h2>
        <div class="security-badge">
            <span>🛡️ AES-256 GCM On-Device Encryption</span>
        </div>
        <p>
            If you provide a personal Gemini API or AI provider key, it is encrypted and stored locally using the Android Jetpack <code>EncryptedSharedPreferences</code> library with hardware-backed Keystore security (AES-256 GCM).
        </p>
        <p>
            Your API key is transmitted exclusively from your device directly to the official Google Gemini API endpoint over an encrypted TLS connection to fulfill your generation requests. It is never routed through, stored on, or accessible to our developer servers.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Third-Party AI Services</h2>
        <p>
            When you request content generation (such as viral titles, retention hooks, or SEO tags), the prompt text you enter (channel niche, topic, and audience) is sent via HTTPS to the official Google Gemini API service.
        </p>
        <p>
            For more details on Google's AI data policies and how Google handles API prompts, please review the 
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a> and 
            <a href="https://ai.google.dev/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google AI Studio Terms of Service</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Device Permissions</h2>
        <p>CreatorPulse requests only minimal, non-sensitive Android install-time permissions:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>android.permission.INTERNET:</strong> Required strictly to communicate with the AI API endpoints for generating titles, scripts, and SEO tags.</li>
            <li><strong>android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE:</strong> Used to check if an active internet connection is available before attempting network operations, providing smooth offline fallback mode.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do NOT request access to your camera, microphone, contacts, location, or local file storage.</p>

        <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
            Our Application does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13. If you are a parent or guardian and believe that your child has provided us with personal data, please contact us immediately.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Data Control & Deletion</h2>
        <p>
            You have full control over your data:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>You can view and delete individual saved drafts, titles, and hooks directly from the <strong>Idea Vault</strong>.</li>
            <li>You can clear your entire history and stored API keys with one click inside the <strong>Settings</strong> screen.</li>
            <li>Uninstalling the app immediately and permanently erases all locally stored databases and preferences from your device.</li>
        </ul>

